# Sanctioned exceptions for pkg-tiers.sh (tier dependency rules).
# One `<repo-relative-file>:<import-path>` entry per line; comments start with #.
#
# Use sparingly — a real cross-tier edge that must ship in a bundle almost always
# means the dependency belongs at a lower tier (or the code should not use it).
# *_test.bn files are already exempt and never need an entry here.
#
# (Baseline is clean as of 2026-07-10 — no entries.)
